                                                "sense_id": "c218fa2b-ac9b-304f-93e8-b9f2af015817",
                                                "text": "Penncrest Portable washing machine, like new. Best ofter, Also baby crib, play pen, and diaper changer, 467-9405, after 6."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13218a21-e015-46b9-9107-b1160f675f8a",
                                                "sense_id": "c218fa2b-ac9b-304f-93e8-b9f2af015817",
                                                "text": "Accessories for a new baby; above – a layette with bassinet, towel and sheets; painted baskets for cotton wool and creams; a Beatrix Potter fabric traveling basket with a diaper changer that zips up into a bag; a contemporary English willow bassinet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a3d6637-a420-4292-a3d9-b3a775d3d600",
                                                "sense_id": "c218fa2b-ac9b-304f-93e8-b9f2af015817",
                                                "text": "The Royal Flush Comfort Station will be available featuring: Men's Side: 2 flushing toilets, 6 ft. urinal, sink, soap, towels, mirror, diaper changer and trash receptacle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1eead31-5e41-4398-aa53-b5e84f833062",
                                                "sense_id": "c218fa2b-ac9b-304f-93e8-b9f2af015817",
                                                "text": "The bathroom has an adult-sized toilet, child-sized toilet for those potty training, as well as two diaper changers. Drinking fountain, but no bottle refill station."
